 "hw1":[{"q":"A typical society strives to get the most it can from its scarce resources. At the same time, the society attempts to distribute the benefits of those resources to the members of the society in a fair manner. In other words, the society faces a tradeoff between","o":["guns and butter.","efficiency and equality.","inflation and unemployment.","work and leisure."],"a":1,"hw":"作業 CH1-2 #1","ch":1,"qz":"一個社會想從稀少資源中得到最多，同時又想把好處公平分配。這個社會面對的取捨是","oz":["大砲與奶油（國防 vs 民生）","效率與公平","通膨與失業","工作與休閒"],"e":"把餅做大 = 效率；分得公平 = 公平。"},{"q":"Suppose that you have received $300 as a birthday gift. You can spend it today or you can put the money in a bank account for a year and earn 5 percent interest. The opportunity cost of spending the money today, in terms of what you could have after one year, is","o":["$0.","$15.","$305.","$315."],"a":3,"hw":"作業 CH1-2 #2","ch":1,"qz":"你收到 $300 禮金，可以今天花掉，或存銀行一年拿 5% 利息。用一年後能擁有的金額來看，今天花掉的機會成本是","e":"一年後可以有 300 × 1.05 = 315。"},{"q":"Senator Bright, who understands economic principles, is trying to convince workers in her district that trade with other countries is beneficial. Senator Bright should argue that trade can be beneficial","o":["only if it allows us to obtain things that we couldn't make for ourselves.","because it allows specialization, which increases total output.","to us if we can gain and the others involved in the trade lose.","in only a limited number of circumstances because others are typically self-interested."],"a":1,"hw":"作業 CH1-2 #3","ch":1,"qz":"Bright 參議員想說服勞工「和其他國家貿易有好處」。她應該主張貿易有好處，因為","oz":["只有在能取得我們自己做不出來的東西時才有好處","貿易讓大家專業分工，總產量增加","只要我們賺、別人虧就有好處","只在少數情況有好處，因為別人都自利"],"e":"貿易好處來自專業分工，總產出增加。"},{"q":"The “invisible hand” works to promote general well-being in the economy primarily through","o":["government intervention.","the political process.","people’s pursuit of self-interest.","altruism."],"a":2,"hw":"作業 CH1-2 #4","ch":1,"qz":"「看不見的手」主要透過什麼促進整體經濟福祉？","oz":["政府干預","政治程序","人們追求自身利益","利他主義"],"e":"看不見的手 = 每個人追求自利，被價格引導到對社會好的結果。"},{"q":"If an externality is present in a market, economic efficiency may be enhanced by","o":["government intervention.","a decrease in foreign competition.","fewer market participants.","weaker property rights."],"a":0,"hw":"作業 CH1-2 #5","ch":1,"qz":"市場有外部性時，什麼可能提升經濟效率？","oz":["政府干預","減少外國競爭","減少市場參與者","較弱的財產權"],"e":"外部性是市場失靈，政府介入可能改善效率。"}],
