 "hw3":[{"q":"If Shawn can produce more donuts in one day than Sue can produce in one day, then","o":["Shawn has a comparative advantage in the production of donuts.","Sue has a comparative advantage in the production of donuts.","Shawn has an absolute advantage in the production of donuts.","Sue has an absolute advantage in the production of donuts."],"a":2,"hw":"作業 CH2-3 #8","ch":3,"qz":"如果 Shawn 一天能做的甜甜圈比 Sue 多，那麼","oz":["Shawn 在甜甜圈有比較利益","Sue 在甜甜圈有比較利益","Shawn 在甜甜圈有絕對利益","Sue 在甜甜圈有絕對利益"],"e":"只比產量 = 絕對優勢。不知道機會成本，無法判斷比較優勢。"},{"q":"The principle of comparative advantage does not provide answers to certain questions. One of those questions is","o":["Is it possible for specialization and trade to benefit more than one party to a trade?","Is it possible for specialization and trade to increase total output of traded goods?","Do opportunity costs play a role in people’s decisions to specialize in certain activities?","What determines the price at which trade takes place?"],"a":3,"hw":"作業 CH2-3 #9","ch":3,"qz":"比較利益原理無法回答某些問題。下列哪一個是它回答不了的？","oz":["專業分工和貿易能不能讓不只一方受益？","專業分工和貿易能不能增加總產量？","機會成本在專業分工決策中有沒有作用？","交易價格是由什麼決定的？"],"e":"比較優勢只告訴你價格範圍，不決定實際價格。"},{"q":"Suppose that a worker in Freedonia can produce either 6 units of corn or 2 units of wheat per year, and a worker in Sylvania can produce either 2 units of corn or 6 units of wheat per year. Each nation has 10 workers. Without trade, Freedonia produces and consumes 30 units of corn and 10 units of wheat per year. Sylvania produces and consumes 10 units of corn and 30 units of wheat. Suppose that trade is then initiated between the two countries, and Freedonia sends 30 units of corn to Sylvania in exchange for 30 units of wheat. Freedonia will now be able to consume a maximum of","o":["30 units of corn and 30 units of wheat.","40 units of corn and 30 units of wheat.","40 units of corn and 20 units of wheat.","10 units of corn and 40 units of wheat."],"a":0,"hw":"作業 CH2-3 #10","ch":3,"qz":"Freedonia 一個工人能生產 6 玉米或 2 小麥；Sylvania 一個工人能生產 2 玉米或 6 小麥。兩國各有 10 個工人。Freedonia 用 30 玉米換 Sylvania 的 30 小麥。Freedonia 現在最多能消費","oz":["30 玉米和 30 小麥","40 玉米和 30 小麥","40 玉米和 20 小麥","10 玉米和 40 小麥"],"e":"Freedonia 全做玉米 = 60，送出 30 → 剩 30 玉米 + 換來 30 小麥。"}],
